WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.507
LABEL. Head, eyes, ears, nose and mouth on a person.

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:07.225
DO. Eyes look at a picture and ears listen to a bell.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:10.329
MOVE. Hands clap; legs walk.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:15.247
CARE. Every body deserves respect and kindness.
